==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|déviant}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈdiː.vi.ənt/|lang=en}}
{{rfap|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Characterized by deviation from an [[expectation]] or a [[social]] [[standard]].
#: ''At the trial, the extent of his '''deviant''' behavior became clear.''

